 "il_version_sites": {
  "_about": "PR #44 (P2): Israeli publisher / aggregator sites that publish ONE page per technical version (title / H1 / URL slug name the version, spec rows state its engine). src/il_version_pages.py resolves the target's version page on these sites before the agentic acquisition: at most `max_searches` site-restricted searches in total (built from `search_templates`, placeholders {domain} {make_he} {make_en} {model} {year} {engine_l} {hp}; an empty placeholder is dropped), version links followed from a fetched model / price-list page of the same site (acquisition.rank_links), at most `max_fetches` candidate URLs, robots.txt respected, at most one request per `min_interval_s` per domain. A fetched page counts only through the deterministic verdict il_version_pages.version_page_verdict (one version; year, displacement, drivetrain, propulsion, body and power match). `version_path_hints`: URL words of a version page (a candidate link must name the model and either a hint or the model year). Data only: adding a site is a JSON edit. `identity_row_terms`: the spec-row labels a version page's identity is read from (with the title, H1 and URL slug).",
  "sites": [
   {
    "domain": "cartube.co.il",
    "version_path_hints": [
     "מחירון-רכב-חדש"
    ]
   },
   {
    "domain": "icar.co.il",
    "version_path_hints": []
   },
   {
    "domain": "auto.co.il",
    "version_path_hints": [
     "cars"
    ]
   }
  ],
  "search_templates": [
   "site:{domain} {make_he} {model} {year} {engine_l} {hp}",
   "site:{domain} {make_he} {model} {year} מפרט טכני",
   "site:{domain} {make_en} {model} {year} {engine_l}"
  ],
  "max_searches": 3,
  "max_fetches": 6,
  "min_interval_s": 1.0,
  "identity_row_terms": [
